          "kicker": "July defeat",
          "heading": "Henry Pollock hat-trick headlines England's 73-8 rout of Fiji in July",
          "body": "Henry Pollock scored a second-half hat-trick as England ran in 11 tries to beat Fiji 73-8 in July, ending a five-Test losing run of their own. Fiji, ranked 10th in the world, have lost four of five Tests this year. Jake White, the former Bulls director of rugby, takes charge with his first match against Japan still to come, followed by November Nations Championship games against France, Ireland and Italy."
