          "heading": "Scotland's biggest win in their last 11 Tests: 56-0 over Tonga",
          "body": "Across their last 11 Tests, Scotland have scored 348 points. In the same 11 matches they have conceded 299, which works out at 31.6 points scored and 27.2 conceded a game. The biggest win in that window was a 56-0 victory over Tonga, a home International Friendly played in November 2025, and it stands as the widest winning margin across those matches."
