          "kicker": "Selection critique",
          "heading": "Ewen McKenzie says Les Kiss' hand was forced before Bledisloe II",
          "body": "Ewen McKenzie, a former Wallabies head coach, was far from confident of Australia's chances before last Saturday's second Bledisloe Test, saying Les Kiss' hand had been forced by injuries. Len Ikitau was ruled out with a concussion and Ben Donaldson was hurt in the build-up, which pushed Joseph-Aukuso Sua'ali'i into midfield and left the fly-half spot unsettled. McKenzie said the Wallabies had half a dozen fly-half candidates, none with much experience. Australia went on to lose 43-21."
        },
